+## Supply-chain waivers
+
+`pins/supply-chain-waivers.json` is the explicit, owner-visible exception list for the two
+supply-chain gates (`SUPPLY-P1-001`/`002`):
+
+- `compose_digest`: findings the digest cross-check may report without failing (each entry
+  names a compose root, an image-ref glob, a reason, an owner and a `review_by` date).
+- `vuln_scan_pending`: pinned images still awaiting a Trivy vulnerability scan under
+  `--require-vuln` (see `docs/phase7/IMAGE_SCAN_DISPOSITION.md`, `SBOM-P2-003`).
+
+Both gates fail closed: an unwaived finding, a missing/malformed waiver file, or a waiver
+past its `review_by` date fails the check. Waiving is an owner decision recorded alongside
+`ledgers/exception_register.md`.
+
+
 Format:
 
